" href="http://www.iapad.org/publications/ppgis/PPGIS_2004_Intl_track_summary.pdf" class="external text" id="mw9g">the original</a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mw9w">(PDF)</span> on 16 July 2011<span class="reference-accessdate" id="mw-A">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mw-Q">30 September</span> 2010</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=USA+3rd+International+Conference+on+Public+Participation+GIS+%282004%29+-+Track+on+International+Perspectives%3A+Summary+Proceedings%2C+University+of+Wisconsin%E2%80%93Madison%2C+18%E2%80%9320+July+2004%2C+Madison%2C+Wisconsin&amp;rft.pub=iapad.org&amp;rft.date=2004&amp;rft.au=Giacomo+Rambaldi+and+Daniel+Weiner+%28Track+Leaders%29&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.iapad.org%2Fpublications%2Fppgis%2FPPGIS_2004_Intl_track_summary.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AParticipatory+GIS" class="Z3988" about="#mwt6" id="mw-g"></span></span></li>
